{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And a man who commits adultery with the wife of a fellow.</b> Our Rabbis of blessed memory expounded: ״אשת איש״ — to exclude a minor; ״אשת רעהו״ — to exclude a non-Jew; from here [we learn] that there is no kiddushin with a non-Jew."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:27:15.987793392Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}